vLLM b1388b1 changes for gfx1151 (Strix Halo, ROCm 7.13, torch 2.9.1): the RDNA hybrid W4A16 kernel of vLLM PR 40977
backported, plus everything lab/vllm-gfx1201.diff carries. git apply ignores this text before the first diff header.

Base: vllm-project/vllm b1388b1fbf5aaef47937fabe98931211684666a6 (2026-04-17), the commit the pods build today. It stays
C++17 and needs no newer torch; vLLM main (C++20, torch 2.11 or newer) is the other route.
Kernel source: vLLM main 276fbcff2 (2026-10-10), which carries PR 40977 (382bbd514, 2026-07-14) and its three later
tunings: dc2e8f115 (#54965, zero points kept packed 4-bit), b267fe488 (#56301, gfx11 stride padding), 5281e4990 (#52619,
medium-skinny dispatch). The four new files are taken whole from 276fbcff2 and adapted as noted below.
Check: git apply --check passes on a fresh shallow checkout of b1388b1 (22 files, 35 hunks).
vLLM logs the selected kernel once per type: "Using RDNAHybridW4A16LinearKernel for CompressedTensorsWNA16"
(compressed_tensors_wNa16.py line 112 at b1388b1). The teacher's serve step greps it into its ledger line.

Hunk by hunk.

From lab/vllm-gfx1201.diff (20 hunks over 12 files, all KEPT unchanged; the base did not move):
  pyproject.toml (2 hunks)            kept: drop the torch == 2.10.0 build pin and the uv no-build-isolation line so the
                                      pod's torch 2.9.1 builds it.
  requirements/build.txt (1)          kept: same torch pin.
  requirements/rocm-build.txt (1)     kept: same, ROCm side.
  vllm/platforms/__init__.py (1)      kept: ROCm detection through torch.version.hip when amdsmi is absent (the pods have
                                      no amdsmi Python package). Upstream later fixed the WSL case: 1ebff996a (#38434).
  vllm/platforms/rocm.py (1 of 3)     kept: no warning_once inside _get_gcn_arch (circular import). Upstream removed it
                                      in 4f1da84eb (#46516).
  triton_unified_attention.py (2)     kept: num_stages=1 (the 64 KB LDS limit; gfx1151 also has 64 KB per workgroup).
  csrc/quantization/gptq/compat.cuh   kept: no duplicate atomicAdd(half/half2) on ROCm 7.13. Upstream guards it with
                                      HIP_VERSION since 6881c754e1c (#41802).
  awq_marlin.py (3)                   kept: AWQ pack-order conversion fix.
  quark/quark.py (4), quark/schemes/__init__.py (2), quark/schemes/quark_w4a16_int4.py (new),
  quark/utils.py (1)                  kept: the Quark W4A16 INT4 scheme. Not on the teacher's path (RedHatAI
                                      compressed-tensors model); carried so one patch covers both.

New for the hybrid kernel (15 hunks, 4 of them whole new files):
  csrc/rocm/skinny_gemms_int4.cu (new)        CHANGED from main: std::in_range is C++20; replaced <utility> with <limits>
                                              and the check with b_row_stride_bytes <= std::numeric_limits<int>::max()
                                              (the value is int64 and already checked >= K/2, so the tests agree).
  CMakeLists.txt (1)                          new: skinny_gemms_int4.cu added to VLLM_ROCM_EXT_SRC.
  csrc/rocm/ops.h (1)                         new: wvSplitK_int4_g declaration, as in PR 40977.
  csrc/rocm/torch_bindings.cpp (1)            new: wvSplitK_int4_g schema and impl, as on main.
  vllm/_custom_ops.py (1)                     new: wvSplitK_int4_g wrapper and its register_fake, as on main.
  vllm/platforms/rocm.py (2 of 3)             new: on_gfx1151() and on_gfx12x() helpers (main has them; b1388b1 has only
                                              on_gfx1x()). Plain arch-string checks, no CDNA exclusion needed for gfx11.
  kernels/linear/__init__.py (3)              new: RDNAHybridW4A16LinearKernel imported, FIRST in the ROCm list (b1388b1
                                              has no RDNA3W4A16 or TritonW4A16 kernel; the list was Conch, Exllama), and
                                              exported.
  kernels/linear/mixed_precision/__init__.py (2)  new: imported and exported.
  mixed_precision/rdna_hybrid_w4a16.py (new)  CHANGED from main: _get_weight_params returns four values at b1388b1
                                              (w_q, w_s, w_zp, _); the has_g_idx guard in can_implement is restored
                                              (b1388b1 still supports act-order g_idx; main removed it in 2c9d68f80, so
                                              an act-order model falls back to Exllama instead of computing wrong output).
  tests/kernels/quantization/test_rdna_hybrid_w4a16.py (new)  CHANGED from main: has_g_idx=False added to the 4
                                              MPLinearLayerConfig calls (a required field at b1388b1).
  benchmarks/kernels/benchmark_rdna_hybrid_w4a16_gemm.py (new)  unchanged from main.

